<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14448] Failure to connect to node leads to hanging connection future if paired connections are used</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14448</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; ((CommunicationSpi&amp;lt;?&amp;gt;)spi &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;instanceof&lt;/span&gt; TcpCommunicationSpi)
            getTcpCommunicationSpi().setConnectionRequestor(invConnHandler);

       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (connRequestor != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;) {
...
           &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (isPairedConnection(node, tcpCommSpi))
               &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throw&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; IgniteSpiException(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Inverse connection protocol doesn&apos;t support paired connections&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turns out this exception is not handled property and connection future is never done. Then, striped pool threads wait forever on reserveClient() and cluster grinds to halt.This happens in versions which have communication-via-discovery and when usePairedConnections=true.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
